{
  "id": "2SA.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samweli 20",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosaria gwa Seba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba ng’a nareenge agwo Giligali omonto omoomboganu, ore korokwa Seba, mosinto o Bikiri bw’egesaku gia Benjamini. Ere akabugia egetuureri, akabora, “Ngetari ki tobwate ase Daudi? Titori nomwando na mosinto o Yese! Inwe Abaisraeli, geenda kera omonto bwoye!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Abaisraeli bonsi bagatiga Daudi, bakabwatia Seba, mosinto o Bikiri; korende Abayuda bakabwatia omorwoti obo korwa Yorodani goika Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Daudi aigete inka bwoye agwo Yerusalemu, akaira abakungu baye ikomi ba sere‐sere, abwo atigete bakorenda enyomba, akababeeka aase baranyare korendwa, akaba okobarageria, korende tachiete koba nabarabwo. Barabwo bakaba basiekeire aase agwo ase amatuko onsi bareenge moyo, bakaba bakomenya buna abatakanwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agateebia Amasa, “Rangeria Abayuda bache ase ’nde ekero amatuko atato ataraera; naye obe aiga ase engaki eyio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasa akageenda kobarangeria, korende agateebana, tairana ase engaki eria omorwoti, amobeekerete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agateebia Abisai, “Bono Seba, mosinto o Bikiri, nigo agochia gotorentera emechando kobua eria Abisalomu atorenterete. Ira abasomba bane momobwatie, erinde tabaisa kwenyorera emechie ye chindwaki na gotokora bobe mono kobua.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto ba Yoabu, na Abakereti, na Abapeleti, ne chituoni chionsi, bagatunyana Abisai, bakarua Yerusalemu bakabwatia Seba, mosinto o Bikiri, bachie komobwata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero baigete ase rigena rinene agwo Gibeoni, Amasa agachia kobarotota. Yoabu nigo abegete chianga chiaye chi’eseegi, na nigo eboeranetie omoyio o birende ase orokini. Ekero are goocha, omoyio oria okagwa inse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu agakwania Amasa, “Mbuya ore oyominto?” Erio akamobwata chinderu nokoboko gw’okorio buna nigo arigetie komonyunyunta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasa teritete",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "korwa ase omoyio oria Yoabu abwate koboko kwaye. Ase igo Yoabu akamobeta omoyio oria enda, na amara akagwa inse. Erio agwo Amasa agakwa, na Yoabu tamoaka eria kabere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Yoabu na Abisai, momura omwabo, bakabwatia Seba, mosinto o Bikiri, gochia komoita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyomo bw’abasomba ba Yoabu agatenena ang’e nomobere bw’Amasa akabora, “Oyo omwanchete Yoabu na oyore oyo’Daudi, tiga atuny’ane Yoabu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Amasa igo arenge kogara‐gara ase amanyinga, gati‐gati y’enchera enene. Ekero omosomba oria arooche ng’a abanto bonsi batenenire, akaimokia omobere bw’Amasa korwa inchera, akayoruta mogondo ime, akayobisia egetambaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero arusetigwe inchera, abanto bonsi bagaeta, bagatunyana Yoabu, erinde babwatie Seba, mosinto o Bikiri, gochia komoita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seba agaeta egati ye chingongo chi’ebisaku bionsi bi’Abaisraeli, agaika omochie o Abeli Beti‐Maaka, na Ababeri bonsi bagasangererekana amo, bakamotunyana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi abareenge na Yoabu bagaacha Abeli Beti‐Maaka, bakamonaria",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", bakaagacha eburi bosio bw’omochie kororia orwaki, na abanto bagachaaka gotagora orwaki ng’a baroiyerie inse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omokungu gete omong’aini akarangeria korwa ase orwaki rw’omochie, agateeba, “Tegerera, tegerera! Teebia Yoabu ache aiga ang’e, ’nkwane nere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu agasuka gochia ang’e ase are, na omokungu oria akamobooria, “Naye Yoabu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akairaneria, “Ee, ninche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omokungu oria akamoteebia, “Tegerera amang’ana ane, inche omosomba oo omokungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoabu akairaneria, “Nintegererete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omokungu oria akamoteebia, “Agwo kare abanto nigo banarete goteeba: Geenda Abeli, omochie oyio, erinde onyore ogoseemigwa; ayio naro arenge gokoora amang’ana abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intwe nigo tore abanto b’omorembe na abegenwa ase Abaisraeli. Inee! Aye nigo origetie gosiria omochie oyo ore ng’ina ase egati y’Abaisraeli? Nase ki oganetie gosaria omwando bw’Omonene?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu akamoiraneria, “Ayio tiga abe are nainche; timbaisa gosaria omochie na koyosiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyio tari oro omooroberio oito, korende omonto oyomo bw’ense y’ebitunwa ya Efraimu, Seba, mosinto o Bikiri, oimokire koba mamincha y’omorwoti Daudi. Mosokie, nainche indue aa ase omochie oyo”!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omokungu oria akamoiraneria, “Rigereria, noruterwe omotwe oye ase orwaki igoro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omokungu oria akaebereria abanto bonsi ase chiseemi, na barabwo bakabutora Seba, mosinto o Bikiri, omotwe, bakayoruta gochia isiko ase Yoabu. Erio Yoabu akabugia egetuureri, na abanto bonsi bagaserebeekana; kera omonto akageenda bwoye. Na Yoabu akairana Yerusalemu ase omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abakoreri ba Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu nere orenge omochiki bw’abarwani bonsi b’esegi ase Abaisraeli, na Benaya, mosinto o Yehoyada, nigo arenge omoteneneri bw’Abakereti na Abapeleti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adorama nigo abegetwe koba omoteneneri bw’emeremo ende yonsi. Yehosafati mosinto bw’Ahiludi, nigo areenge omoriki bw’amang’ana are gokoreka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sheva nomoriiki oreenge, na Zadoki na Abiatari nabakuani bareenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nabwo, Ira Omoyairi nigo areenge Omokuani ase Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
